records.qn_text:
a.	whether it is a fact that India has asked Organization of Petroleum Exporting Countries (OPEC) to raise their crude oil output and squeeze skyrocketing prices;

b.	if so, the details of the request and whether there has been any reaction from OPEC;

c.	whether it is also a fact that oil  starved countries including India would intensify their campaign to find crude oil substitutes on a war footing; and

d.	if so, the details of the efforts being made by Government in this regard?
